  "details": "1. Build & Test a PC Avatar with account A\n\n2. Log into VRChat with account B\n\n3. Look into the SDK Avatars menu: The avatar is available\n\nI suspect this might be because the SDK avatar is stored in a common location on the PC VRChat file path, and has no account specific information.\n\nAlso, all the SDK avatars can be seen from the SDK Control Panel Content Manager, regardless of account used to log into the Control Panel.\n\nThis isn't probably such a big issue, but thought I would point it out.",
